                            <Paragraph>
                              <TextRuns>
                                <TextRun>
                                  <Value>="Kindly return 2 copies of the above mentioned account statement and Balanace Confirmation letter, duly signed and stamped, in confirmation of the same. Please note that if no reply is received from you within a 15 Days, it will be assumed that you have accepted the balance shown above."</Value>
                                  <Style>
